Package: kosmos-samba-mods
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, samba, adduser
Description: Enables and preconfigures Samba for KosmOS users.
 This package enables automatic Samba password sync to keep
 Samba user password in sync with system user password.
 .
 It also enables automatic user homes sharing with write
 permission.
